cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DSCNS: Dynamic Self-Modifying Cognitive Neural System"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype exploring dynamic modular neural systems with
  continual learning, candidate knowledge validation, selective
  internalization, memory, meta-cognition, structural evolution,
  learned structural self-modification (Phase 4), intrinsic
  parameter self-modification (Phase 5: theta -> h -> delta_theta ->
  theta'), and error-conditioned self-modification with self-determined
  magnitude (Phase 5.1). Early research prototype (v0.4.0); experimental
  results include mixed and negative findings and should be interpreted
  conservatively.
